msgid "[{ASSO_NAME}] Your identifiers"
msgstr "[{ASSO_NAME}] Vaši identifikatorji"

msgid ""
"Hello,{NEWLINE}You've just been subscribed on the members management system "
"of {ASSO_NAME}.{NEWLINE}It is now possible to follow in real time the state "
"of your subscription and to update your preferences from the web interface."
"{NEWLINE}Please login at this address to set your new password :{BR}"
"{CHG_PWD_URI}{NEWLINE}Username: {LOGIN}{BR}The above link will be valid "
"until {LINK_VALIDITY}.{NEWLINE}See you soon!{NEWLINE}(this email was sent "
"automatically)"
msgstr ""
"Pozdravljeni,{NEWLINE}Pravkar ste se naročili v sistem za upravljanje članov "
"{ASSO_NAME}.{NEWLINE}Zdaj lahko v realnem času spremljate stanje svoje "
"naročnine in posodabljate svoje nastavitve prek spletnega vmesnika.{NEWLINE}"
"Za nastavitev novega gesla se prijavite na ta naslov:{BR}{CHG_PWD_URI}"
"{NEWLINE}Uporabniško ime: {LOGIN}{BR}Zgornja povezava bo veljavna do "
"{LINK_VALIDITY}.{NEWLINE}Se vidimo kmalu!{NEWLINE}(to e-poštno sporočilo je "
"bilo poslano samodejno)"

msgid "New user registration"
msgstr "Registracija novega uporabnika"

msgid ""
"Hello,{NEWLINE}Someone (probably you) asked to recover your password."
"{NEWLINE}Please login at this address to set your new password :{BR}"
"{CHG_PWD_URI}{NEWLINE}Username: {LOGIN}{BR}The above link will be valid "
"until {LINK_VALIDITY}.{NEWLINE}See you soon!{NEWLINE}(this email was sent "
"automatically)"
msgstr ""
"Pozdravljeni,{NEWLINE}Nekdo (verjetno vi) je prosil za obnovitev vašega "
"gesla.{NEWLINE}Za nastavitev novega gesla se prijavite na ta naslov:{BR}"
"{CHG_PWD_URI}{NEWLINE}Uporabniško ime: {LOGIN}{BR}Zgornja povezava bo "
"veljavna do {LINK_VALIDITY}.{NEWLINE}Se vidimo kmalu!{NEWLINE}(to e-poštno "
"sporočilo je bilo poslano samodejno)"

msgid "Lost password email"
msgstr "E-poštni naslov za izgubljeno geslo"

msgid "[{ASSO_NAME}] Your contribution"
msgstr "[{ASSO_NAME}] Vaš prispevek"

msgid ""
"Hello,{NEWLINE}Your contribution has successfully been taken into account by "
"{ASSO_NAME}.{NEWLINE}It is valid until {DEADLINE}.{NEWLINE}You can now login "
"and browse or modify your personal data using your galette identifiers at "
"this address:{BR}{LOGIN_URI}.{NEWLINE}{CONTRIB_INFO}{NEWLINE}See you soon!"
"{NEWLINE}(this email was sent automatically)"
msgstr ""
"Pozdravljeni,{NEWLINE}Vaš prispevek je uspešno upošteval/a {ASSO_NAME}."
"{NEWLINE}Velja do {DEADLINE}.{NEWLINE}Zdaj se lahko prijavite in brskate ali "
"spreminjate svoje osebne podatke z uporabo identifikatorjev galette na tem "
"naslovu:{BR}{LOGIN_URI}.{NEWLINE}{CONTRIB_INFO}{NEWLINE}Se vidimo kmalu!"
"{NEWLINE}(to e-poštno sporočilo je bilo poslano samodejno)"

